Procedural Map Generation for Dust Trail - Overview

Slice: Procedural Map Generation
Status: Complete (2026-11-17)

What was implemented:
- Deterministic world generation from seed in procgen.rs
- World::generate(seed) integration in world.rs  
- Game::new_with_seed(seed) and Game::new() in game.rs
- 7 headless property tests verifying determinism, connectivity, and borders
- Connectivity guarantee via BFS from player start (2,2) to sheriff, outlaw, loot
- Retry logic (up to 10 attempts) for playability
- Fixed 40×22 map targeting <10ms generation time

